1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:01,686
It's late.

2
00:00:01,850 --> 00:00:03,984
The house is a total mess...

3
00:00:05,350 --> 00:00:07,491
...and Mom is finally asleep.

4
00:00:11,450 --> 00:00:13,465
MOM: Mmm... five more minutes.

5
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:17,523
So tonight, you and your siblings have one job.

6
00:00:22,050 --> 00:00:23,461
Pair up the slippers.

7
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:25,553
Stack the mugs.

8
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:27,821
Fold the towels.

9
00:00:28,750 --> 00:00:30,053
Scrub the plates.

10
00:00:35,150 --> 00:00:38,967
Jobs in every room... and one clock for everybody.

11
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:48,313
...without making a single sound.

12
00:00:51,750 --> 00:00:52,842
...Mostly.

13
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:54,180
The cat is bored.

14
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:55,943
The dog is hungry.

15
00:00:56,400 --> 00:00:58,620
Your siblings are... not helping.

16
00:00:58,750 --> 00:01:01,720
And every little noise wakes Mom up a little more.

17
00:01:04,150 --> 00:01:06,571
MOM: I am getting up. I am really getting up.

18
00:01:06,850 --> 00:01:08,946
MOM: WHO is making that noise?!

19
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:11,718
MOM: Why are things moving around out there?

20
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:18,572
And when she finds a mess... somebody's getting blamed.

21
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:21,051
MOM: Alright... who did this? Show me.

22
00:01:21,350 --> 00:01:23,144
MOM: Aha! It was you.

23
00:01:23,450 --> 00:01:29,702
MOM: ...the quietest, most helpful kid in this house. I'm SO proud. Now everybody... SLEEP!

24
00:01:28,300 --> 00:01:30,489
MOM: Goodnight. And keep it DOWN.

25
00:01:31,050 --> 00:01:34,183
So be quick. Be helpful. And whatever you do...

26
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:37,969
Shhh. Don't wake Mom.
